WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Dormant leads don't say no. They just stop answering.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.800
The leads you already paid for sit in the sheet, months cold, with nobody following up. Follow-ups sent: zero.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.500
Context wakes them up. A blast buries them.

00:15.500 --> 00:21.800
The workflow reads the original conversation, writes a three-sentence check-in, sends it signed, and drops the lead name in Discord.

00:22.000 --> 00:26.000
It sends itself. Then it haunts you.

00:26.000 --> 00:29.500
The row flips to Sent, and #dead-leads names the lead so you know who came back from the dead.
